## How the opening was measured

84.09% of pixels in Claudia’s opening have a mean absolute RGB difference of 20 or less on a 0–255 scale against the original at 864 × 1536. This statistic describes the approved camera position. For hidden parts of the course, inspect shape, depth, materials, occlusion and continuity in motion. The detailed report includes Pixelmatch results and camera checks. [Native measurements](../../05_REVIEW_RECORDS/Screen_08/Chamber_Flow_Distance/measurements/matched-gameplay-and-opening.json)

